{"title":"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf775d84b7c9011e998a5429e714f1bab66da1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2+a_4+a_6+a_8+\\ldots+a_{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"222\" height=\"13\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/a/a9affc65147c76db8cc3ba53f3d5bd1648b5d7f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_3\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> is an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_progression\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arithmetic progression\">arithmetic progression</a> with common difference 1, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/a/aba5ffa5208cbd78e5a4e4f8a6f54d39dfceea5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+a_2+a_3+\\ldots+a_{98}=137$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"238\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One approach is to sum an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_series\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arithmetic series\">arithmetic series</a>, find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />, and sum another arithmetic series to get the answer. A quicker method is to substitue <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/1/39125100637d81f4de631b10d0143585e6bd42a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2n - 1} = a_{2n} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"14\" /> into the given equation: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f2829a37d02d5c766421ae3fc4d6426bc2082f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a_2 - 1) + a_2 + (a_4 - 1) + a_4 + \\ldots + (a_{98} - 1) + a_{98} = 137\\]\" width=\"456\" height=\"18\" />\nSimplify the LHS:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93299a069cf59cd689671e72825905b8666fc15.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2(a_2 + a_4 + \\ldots + a_{98}) - 49= 137\\]\" width=\"260\" height=\"18\" />\nSolve:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/f/1bfa88eff10c68e087b452658fca61ba34f41612.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_2 + a_4 + \\ldots + a_{98}=\\frac{137 + 49}{2} = \\boxed{93}\\]\" width=\"295\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> is the first term, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/6/db6c6e1e463ad906e220f8c6a2f91382dda9a621.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+a_2+a_3 + \\cdots + a_{98} = 137$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"236\" height=\"15\" /> can be rewritten as:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/a/02af675468078a607e2f686921083ef2a2f70154.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$98a_1 + 1+2+3+ \\cdots + 97 = 137$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"264\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6ec0db174f3b705df19623976bf4b88ff502f3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Leftrightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"9\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/0/c40e85376f4547511b01c21858750b430df33390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$98a_1 + \\frac{97 \\cdot 98}{2} = 137$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"162\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Our desired value is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c75485b9284391b468cf3bc37fe47c16cfa1219.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2+a_4+a_6+ \\cdots + a_{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"183\" height=\"13\" /> so this is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/b/14b7e6284485250f7243ac5be937a2c6f55ae04f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49a_1 + 1+3+5+ \\cdots + 97$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"213\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a0cc0c4ec455fb5384211ff6c551a1b81885e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49a_1+ 49^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" />. So, from the first equation, we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/0/cc047c028b1a260fa23f9466c8546e38fb8860e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49a_1 = \\frac{137}{2} - \\frac{97 \\cdot 49}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"164\" height=\"37\" />. So, the final answer is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5caa9e3c11f3e4a3c91593fab7df256a943e545.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{137 - 97(49) + 2(49)^2}{2} = \\fbox{93}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"227\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A better approach to this problem is to notice that from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6bd0e4dd8787a6f607c70ae4b28e6a6ecc3ac6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{1}+a_{2}+\\cdots a_{98}=137$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"177\" height=\"15\" /> that each element with an odd subscript is 1 from each element with an even subscript. Thus, we note that the sum of the odd elements must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/8/928ef7250c2997b1b9f608eabcac68714336fba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{137-49}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"70\" height=\"37\" />. Thus, if we want to find the sum of all of the even elements we simply add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> common differences to this giving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/7/7a743e21ac4d6608cef0fd91754596361bd431e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{137-49}{2}+49=\\fbox{93}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"164\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Or, since the sum of the odd elements is 44, then the sum of the even terms must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/e/71e95661a0dc36a40b251b64576f79658511c94b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{93}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"30\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We want to find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf775d84b7c9011e998a5429e714f1bab66da1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2+a_4+a_6+a_8+\\ldots+a_{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"222\" height=\"13\" />, which can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a08f6fce83c008491f3ebd687920c2452c1ec7b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+1+a_2+2+a_3+\\ldots+a_{49}+49 \\implies a_1+a_2+a_3+\\ldots+a_{49}+\\frac{49 \\cdot 50}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"600\" height=\"38\" />.\nWe can split <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaac9609896cd686e16f0df80b7070b0a171b6fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+a_2+a_3+\\ldots+a_{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"187\" height=\"15\" /> into two parts:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/a/0aa3ee0f874c397ce95da16ec53332ee32dd73c6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_1+a_2+a_3+\\ldots+a_{49}\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/a/6ba820d93cd89b3bd9ca64af7562cea24c771a82.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{50}+a_{51}+a_{52}+\\ldots+a_{98}\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"13\" />\nNote that each term in the second expression is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> greater than the corresponding term, so, letting the first equation be equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22af0af2927a37357f98fe5d4f2926c4edcc60e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+a_2+a_3+\\ldots+a_{98}=137=2x+49^2 \\implies x=\\frac{137-49^2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"493\" height=\"41\" />. Calculating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c98eb5a8b14145ec92cff6a21120102fdc07d8a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" /> by sheer multiplication is not difficult, but you can also do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/f/97f1605de516bd703d2ec221b77622eceff71543.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(50-1)(50-1)=2500-100+1=2401$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"331\" height=\"20\" />. We want to find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/8/718fb744ff9227093a6d0467cd46a526906cb367.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+\\frac{49 \\cdot 50}{2}=x+49 \\cdot 25=x+1225$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"287\" height=\"38\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/2/2423ab833e961c713b0f3f763b2ecfb04e124cb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{137-2401}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"126\" height=\"38\" />, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/1/f6120e6f4cd978c19d879304ff930107a746f96b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1132$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/d/61dca787172a96f5c7b1633aa57626a421603c96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1132+1225=\\boxed{93}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"165\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>- PhunsukhWangdu\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since we are dealing with an arithmetic sequence, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/3/a4367dbe6ba0d671405a894331dcc62ae4d6d772.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_2+a_4+a_6+a_8+\\ldots+a_{98} = 49a_{50}\\]\" width=\"287\" height=\"15\" />\nWe can also figure out that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/5/0351745c3ca3c330aa42fe3c8da383c4b007d99c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_1+a_2+a_3+\\ldots+a_{98} = a_1 + 97a_{50} = 137\\]\" width=\"341\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/6152267a68a48632f4d80bba343b1ec7d065bdbe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_1 = a_{50}-49 \\Rightarrow 98a_{50}-49 = 137\\]\" width=\"267\" height=\"16\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/8/3c8a2eb9cc1e26ace3fd17c0abbc97f347ef7d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49a_{50} = \\frac{137 + 49}{2} = \\boxed{93}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"193\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~kempwood\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of an arithmetic sequence of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/8/b28e713ce8ba7a89ace450f8c8d3579fa083f991.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_n = \\frac{n}{2}(a_1 + a_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"34\" />.\n</p><p>We are told that the sum of all 98 terms is 137, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/1/8f10a630ba58f5c072b527430c1741c5f273ae45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{98}{2}(a_1 + a_n) = 137$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"148\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The subset of terms <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea9e901a740987ef06a9661ceb987b634d2f3299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2, a_4, a_6, a_8, ...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"13\" /> themselves also form an arithmetic sequence (having common difference 2), so their sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> will be\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/8485610d2d31d333947ed23be6357248ed8bb360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{49}{2}(a_2 + a_{98}) = S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"138\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/9/5e97a8af68fbc8e357d3ee0eba452022b06c1875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/5/a25c61a5785a1ea5235a8e4f5f882435296e1867.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/8/bd849045b26ef60996841501b812dc87068412e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{49}{2}(a_1 + 1 + a_{98}) = S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"169\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Here we have a system of two equations. Manipulating the first equation yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda9b5b7144576ae8ac87dd49271757abcccd59b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 + a_{98} = \\frac{137}{49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"120\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>And putting this into the second equation,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d15a9f563014c9902a880d3399ff96c7794f288.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\frac{49}{2}(1 + \\frac{137}{49}) = \\fbox{093}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"198\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/re8DTg-Lbu0?t=234\">https://youtu.be/re8DTg-Lbu0?t=234</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME\" title=\"1984 AIME\">1984 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\">AIME Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Invitational_Mathematics_Examination\" title=\"American Invitational Mathematics Examination\">American Invitati